[21.343282, "o", "deny\r\nA rule of this project’s record refuses a write at src/billing/invoice.ts while it stands.\r\n“Keep money as integer cents”: refuses a write at src/billing · \r\n01a183c6-2bc3-7000-985f-00fece415ad6 · accepted by mnid:0779d05b (a person)\r\nThe rule opens with `mnema show 01a183c6-2bc3-7000-985f-00fece415ad6`; changing it is a \r\ndecision for whoever recorded it.\r\nThis refusal covers the editing tools, not the shell: a write to a path a rule governs made \r\nthrough the shell goes round the rule, and is not one the record allows.\r\n"]
[23.745644, "o", "\u001b[2m# the refusal is a signed fact of the record, like the rule it cites\u001b[0m\r\n"]
